  {
    "section": "chapter-2",
    "ordinal": 49,
    "tex": "\\operatorname{Var}\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^nX_i\\right)\r\n=\r\n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{Var}(X_i)\r\n+\r\n2\\sum_{i<j}\\operatorname{Cov}(X_i,X_j).",
